# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT: SPORTS MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
## Production-Ready Full-Stack Web Application – Individual SDF Laboratory Assignment

### 1. PROJECT ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as a Senior Full-Stack Software Architect, UI/UX Designer, Database Engineer, QA Engineer, and DevOps Engineer.

Your task is to independently design, develop, test, and prepare a complete, professional-grade Sports Management System (SMS) web application.

This is an individual Software Development Fundamentals (SDF) laboratory assignment. The problem statement and functional requirements are shared among group members, but the GUI design, implementation, and testing must be individually developed.

Build an original, modern, responsive, fully functional web application that implements every requirement specified in this document.

**IMPORTANT:** This project is intended for actual deployment, not merely an academic prototype or static frontend demonstration. Develop it with production-oriented architecture, proper database integration, authentication, authorization, validation, error handling, testing, and deployment configuration.

Do not skip requirements, leave unfinished pages, use non-functional buttons, or substitute actual functionality with decorative UI elements.

